{
  "name": "cockroach",
  "_about": "The American cockroach (Periplaneta americana), 3.8 cm long: flat and glossy reddish brown; the pronotum a pale yellowish shield hiding the head from above with a dark brown blotch in its middle; leathery wings lying flat over the whole abdomen, the left over the right; antennae as long as the body; long legs bristling with spines; a pair of cerci at the tail. Coat: the German cockroach (small, pale brown, two dark stripes on the pronotum). Written whole by tools/creaturegen/rework/insects/bugs.py on insectlib.py (jointed legs on a walking gait, the antennae on bones of their own that wave).",
